---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About FAST — the Association of Academic Staff at Reykjavík University." pageKey="about">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About FAST</h1>
      <p>FAST is the trade union for academic staff at Reykjavík University and a member union of BHM.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>What is FAST?</h2>
          <p>
            FAST — the Association of Academic Staff at RU — is a trade union that
            safeguards the interests of academic staff at Reykjavík University. The
            association handles interest representation, collective bargaining and
            works to improve its members' working conditions.
          </p>
          <p>
            FAST's members are teachers, professors, associate professors, assistant
            professors, adjuncts, researchers and other academic staff at RU. The
            association also offers a dedicated PhD-student membership for doctoral
            students at Reykjavík University.
          </p>

          <h2>Role and objectives</h2>
          <p>FAST's main objectives are:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>To safeguard members' interests in their terms and rights and to ensure these are fair.</li>
            <li>To promote a better working environment and working conditions at RU.</li>
            <li>To stand guard over academic freedom and job security.</li>
            <li>To strengthen solidarity among academic staff.</li>
            <li>To act as a liaison between members and the university's senior management.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Membership of BHM</h2>
          <p>
            FAST is a member union of <a href="https://www.bhm.is" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BHM — the Icelandic Confederation of University Graduates</a>.
            BHM is an umbrella organisation of 27 trade unions of university-educated
            people in Iceland, representing the interests of more than 30,000 members.
            Through BHM, FAST members take part in collective bargaining and enjoy a
            wide range of rights and benefits.
          </p>

          <h2>Membership</h2>
          <p>
            All academic staff at Reykjavík University are entitled to join FAST.
            Membership fees are collected monthly and go towards running the
            association and its advocacy work.
          </p>
          <p>
            For more information about membership, please contact the association or
            reach out through BHM.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="sidebar">
          <div class="info-box">
            <h3>Key information</h3>
            <dl>
              <dt>Name</dt>
              <dd>FAST — Association of Academic Staff at RU</dd>
              <dt>Type</dt>
              <dd>Trade union</dd>
              <dt>Parent organisation</dt>
              <dd><a href="https://www.bhm.is" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BHM</a></dd>
              <dt>University</dt>
              <dd><a href="https://www.ru.is" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reykjavík University</a></dd>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
  }

  .sidebar {
    order: -1;
  }

  .info-box {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .info-box h3 {
    font-size: var(--size-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .info-box dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
  }

  .info-box dt {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .info-box dd {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .info-box a {
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    }

    .sidebar {
      order: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
